# Phase ε self-ingestion + archive snapshots — never staged
.ontology.archive-*/
.ontology.self-ingest-*-result/
.ontology.*-backup/
.ontology.scratch-*/

# Scratch run artifacts (baseline/lever/decompose/exec/probe/diag/fullsuite/…):
# ad-hoc experiment dumps + their logs, never staged. Every run log is scratch,
# every dated result/backup dir is scratch, and every sidecar JSON is scratch
# EXCEPT the pre-registered records enumerated below.
.ontology.*.log
.ontology.*-result/
.ontology.pre-*/
.ontology.*-backup-*/
.ontology.*.json
# ...but these sidecar JSONs are intentionally TRACKED — the raw pre-registered
# output of Move 3α (self-ingest ε Arm A/A0/B/C-local + synthesis) and the
# 2026-06-09 contract-column baseline, living next to their reports in
# docs/legend/calibrations/. Keep them versioned; never let the catch-all above
# swallow them:
!.ontology.self-ingest-epsilon-*.json
!.ontology.contract-column-2026-06-09.json

# Compiled/emitted output tree — regenerable, not source.
outputs/

# Automated agent-review snapshots — state hypotheses, not source of truth
# (findings roll into docs/ROADMAP.md). Kept locally, never staged.
AGENT_REVIEW_*.md
# Stray copy of the private ~/.claude memory index — never commit personal notes.
/MEMORY.md
# Root-level scratch experiment dumps (executor/monotone sweeps, probe worklists).
gap2-*.json
monotone-*.json
.probe-*
probe-*.mjs
_chk_tmp.ts

# Workspace artifacts
.claude/
